### Modtra Payment System Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = your-jwt-token-here

###
### 1. VIETQR PAYMENT TESTS
###

### 1.1 Generate VietQR Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/vietqr
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "test-order-id-123"
}

### 1.2 Verify VietQR Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/vietqr/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "transactionRef": "VQR-ORD-20260916-XXXX-1234567890"
}

### 1.3 Get Payment Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/VQR-ORD-20260916-XXXX-1234567890
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### 2. MOMO PAYMENT TESTS
###

### 2.1 Initialize MoMo Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/momo/init
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "test-order-id-456"
}

### 2.2 MoMo Webhook Callback (Simulated - from MoMo server)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/momo/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "1234567890-test-order-id-456",
  "resultCode": 0,
  "message": "Successful",
  "amount": 500000,
  "orderId": "ORD-20260916-0001",
  "transId": "2109131234567890",
  "extraData": "eyJvcmRlcklkIjogInRlc3Qtb3JkZXItaWQtNDU2IiwgInVzZXJJZCI6ICJ1c2VyLWlkLTEyMyJ9"
}

###
### 3. LOYALTY POINTS TESTS
###

### 3.1 Get Loyalty Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loyalty/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 Add Loyalty Points (Internal API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/loyalty/add-points
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Secret: your-internal-secret

{
  "userId": "user-id-123",
  "amount": 1000,
  "reason": "order_purchase",
  "orderId": "order-id-123"
}

### 3.3 Redeem Loyalty Points
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/loyalty/redeem
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 500
}

### 3.4 Get Loyalty History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loyalty/history?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### 4. RECONCILIATION TESTS
###

### 4.1 Trigger Daily Reconciliation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reconciliation/daily
X-Cron-Secret: your-cron-secret

